      \u0441\u0432\u0456\u0439 \u0442\u0440\u043E\u043D!,,\r\nLevelRewardPanel_FirstWinDes1,,,\"That
      wasn\u2019t easy, but you handled it beautifully!\",\"No fue f\xE1cil, \xA1pero
      lo hiciste de maravilla!\",\"N\xE3o foi f\xE1cil, mas voc\xEA mandou muito
