      \u043D\u0430 #{1}!,,\r\nRankResultDes3_1,,,\"Keep the momentum going, the top
      6 is within reach!\",\"\xA1Mant\xE9n el impulso, el top 6 est\xE1 al alcance!\",\"Mantenha
      o ritmo, o top 6 est\xE1 ao seu alcance!\",\"\u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438
      \u0442\u0435\u043C\u043F, \u0442\u043E\u043F-6 \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0431\u043B\u0438\u0437\u043A\u043E!\",\"Bleib
